{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptive-music","title":"自适应音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/practice/adaptive-music","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自适应音乐\">自适应音乐</h1><p>玩家在《塞尔达》里从草原走进遭遇战，音乐没有&quot;切歌&quot;的突兀，而是探索旋律自然让位给战斗节拍——这种&quot;音乐在听我玩&quot;的体验，是程序化思想在音乐上的应用，也是玩家最能直接感知到的程序化音频。自适应音乐不合成单个波形，而是在运行时编排预制的音乐片段，让音乐的结构随玩法状态实时重组。它把系统章的<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-audio\">事件驱动音频</a>与<a href=\"../systems/parametric-sound\">参数化音效</a>两套机制同时用上了——事件触发段落切换，参数驱动叠层强度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>自适应音乐</strong>不合成单个波形，而是在运行时编排预制的音乐片段，让音乐的结构随玩法状态实时重组，是玩家最能直接感知到的程序化音频。它的核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两条正交轴</strong>：横向重排（操作段落顺序）与纵向分层（操作同一时刻的声部层）。</li>\n<li><strong>同步点</strong>：横向切换的难点——切换请求排队到合法节拍/小节才生效，把&quot;何时请求&quot;与&quot;何时生效&quot;解耦。</li>\n<li><strong>紧张度参数</strong>：纵向分层的核心，各层增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 错开阈值得到连续厚度变化，因层对齐而不破坏节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>机制对应</strong>：横向切段本质是离散事件驱动，纵向叠层本质是连续 RTPC 驱动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"两条正交的轴-横向与纵向\">两条正交的轴：横向与纵向</h2><p>自适应音乐有两种不会混淆的基本手法，它们在结构上正交，常常叠加使用。横向重排（horizontal re-sequencing）操作的是时间轴上的&quot;段落顺序&quot;——把音乐切成 A/B/过渡/尾声等段，根据玩法决定下一段播哪个、何时切。纵向分层（vertical layering / re-orchestration）操作的是同一时刻的&quot;叠加厚度&quot;——同一段音乐准备好鼓、贝斯、弦乐、铜管多个声部层，按紧张度增减点亮哪些层。下表把两者摆清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>横向重排</th>\n<th>纵向分层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操作对象</td>\n<td>段落顺序（时间轴）</td>\n<td>声部层（同一时刻）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>离散事件（进入战斗）</td>\n<td>连续参数（紧张度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>听感</td>\n<td>音乐&quot;换了一段&quot;</td>\n<td>音乐&quot;变厚/变薄&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型实现</td>\n<td>标记同步切换</td>\n<td>层音量交叉淡化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对应机制</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>RTPC 参数化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行点明了关键对应：横向切段本质是离散事件驱动，纵向叠层本质是连续 RTPC 驱动。理解这一点，自适应音乐就不再是玄学，而是前两章机制的直接组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"横向重排的同步难题\">横向重排的同步难题</h2><p>横向切换最难的不是&quot;决定切到哪段&quot;，而是&quot;何时切才不破坏节奏&quot;。音乐有小节、有强拍，若在任意一帧硬切，会撞断乐句，听感像 CD 跳针。专业做法是同步点（sync point / marker）——在音乐里预埋节拍/小节标记，切换请求到来时不立即执行，而是排队等到下一个合法同步点（下一拍、下一小节、下一段尾）才真正过渡。这把&quot;何时请求&quot;和&quot;何时生效&quot;解耦了。</p>\n<p>过渡本身也要设计：硬切、交叉淡化、或经一段专门的&quot;过渡段&quot;（transition segment）桥接。下面的图刻画一次战斗触发的横向切换如何排队到同步点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EVT[事件: 进入战斗] --&gt; Q[切换请求入队&lt;br/&gt;目标段=战斗主题]&#10;  CLOCK[音乐时钟&lt;br/&gt;追踪小节/拍] --&gt; SYNC{到达同步点?}&#10;  Q --&gt; SYNC&#10;  SYNC --&gt;|未到| WAIT[继续播当前段&lt;br/&gt;等待]&#10;  WAIT --&gt; SYNC&#10;  SYNC --&gt;|到达| TRANS{需要过渡段?}&#10;  TRANS --&gt;|是| BRIDGE[插入过渡段&lt;br/&gt;桥接]&#10;  TRANS --&gt;|否| FADE[交叉淡化]&#10;  BRIDGE --&gt; NEXT[战斗主题开始]&#10;  FADE --&gt; NEXT\">flowchart TD\n  EVT[事件: 进入战斗] --&gt; Q[切换请求入队&lt;br/&gt;目标段=战斗主题]\n  CLOCK[音乐时钟&lt;br/&gt;追踪小节/拍] --&gt; SYNC{到达同步点?}\n  Q --&gt; SYNC\n  SYNC --&gt;|未到| WAIT[继续播当前段&lt;br/&gt;等待]\n  WAIT --&gt; SYNC\n  SYNC --&gt;|到达| TRANS{需要过渡段?}\n  TRANS --&gt;|是| BRIDGE[插入过渡段&lt;br/&gt;桥接]\n  TRANS --&gt;|否| FADE[交叉淡化]\n  BRIDGE --&gt; NEXT[战斗主题开始]\n  FADE --&gt; NEXT</pre><h2 id=\"纵向分层与紧张度参数\">纵向分层与紧张度参数</h2><p>纵向分层的实现优雅得多：所有声部层从头到尾同步播放，只是用各自的音量被一个&quot;紧张度&quot;参数控制。紧张度低时只有氛围铺底层有声，随紧张度上升，鼓、贝斯、铜管依次淡入。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层在紧张度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 下的增益为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(T) = \\mathrm{clamp}\\!\\left(\\frac{T - t_i}{w_i},\\, 0,\\, 1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层开始淡入的紧张度阈值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是淡入宽度。错开各层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就得到&quot;紧张度越高、乐器越多&quot;的连续厚度变化。因为所有层时间对齐，增减层不会破坏节奏——这是纵向比横向工程上更省心的原因。紧张度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 本身就是一个 RTPC 参数，由战斗系统按敌人数、玩家血量等推算，正是<a href=\"../systems/parametric-sound\">参数化音效</a>里&quot;一个参数驱动多属性&quot;模式的音乐版。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与音效的协同与本-hub-的边界\">与音效的协同与本 hub 的边界</h2><p>自适应音乐不该和音效各自为政。同一个&quot;紧张度&quot;参数最好同时驱动音乐叠层和环境音效（如低频隆隆、心跳），让整个声景统一呼吸——这种音乐与音效共享参数的设计，是高级声景的标志。</p>\n<p>需要划清的是：自适应音乐的&quot;作曲、编曲、混音&quot;等纯音乐制作话题，属于 <code>08_game-audio</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-audio/adaptive-music/adaptive-systems\">自适应系统</a>与<a href=\"../../game-audio/adaptive-music/horizontal-vertical\">横向纵向</a>，那里讲得更全。本 hub 只从&quot;程序化编排机制&quot;这个角度切入——把它当作事件与参数两套机制在音乐域的应用，强调它与音效共享同一套程序化基础设施。落地时，横向同步点与纵向叠层都在中间件里配置，是<a href=\"../systems/audio-middleware\">音频中间件</a>的工程；而多层同时播放的内存与声部成本，是<a href=\"procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a>要算的账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自适应音乐在运行时<strong>编排预制片段</strong>，让音乐结构随玩法重组，是玩家最可感知的程序化音频。</li>\n<li>两条正交轴：<strong>横向重排</strong>（切段落，离散事件驱动）与<strong>纵向分层</strong>（增减声部层，连续 RTPC 驱动）。</li>\n<li>横向的难点是<strong>同步点</strong>——切换请求排队到合法节拍/小节才生效，配合过渡段避免跳针。</li>\n<li>纵向用紧张度参数控制各层增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，错开阈值得到连续厚度变化，因层对齐而不破坏节奏。</li>\n<li>同一紧张度参数应同时驱动音乐与音效，让声景统一呼吸；纯音乐制作话题归 <code>08_game-audio</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>横向切换依赖的机制：<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-audio\">事件驱动音频</a></li>\n<li>纵向叠层依赖的机制：<a href=\"../systems/parametric-sound\">参数化音效</a></li>\n<li>配置工具：<a href=\"../systems/audio-middleware\">音频中间件</a></li>\n<li>多层播放的成本：<a href=\"procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a></li>\n<li>更全的音乐制作视角：<code>08_game-audio</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-audio/adaptive-music/music-game-state\">音乐与游戏状态</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应音乐","id":"自适应音乐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两条正交的轴：横向与纵向","id":"两条正交的轴-横向与纵向"},{"level":2,"text":"横向重排的同步难题","id":"横向重排的同步难题"},{"level":2,"text":"纵向分层与紧张度参数","id":"纵向分层与紧张度参数"},{"level":2,"text":"与音效的协同与本 hub 的边界","id":"与音效的协同与本-hub-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"音频中间件 (Wwise/FMOD)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/systems/audio-middleware"},"next":{"title":"性能与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/practice/procedural-audio-performance"}}